# Only what the API image needs reaches the Docker build. Dependencies and the Prisma client are
# installed and generated inside the image, never copied from a developer machine.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
apps/api/src/generated
.git
.github
.superpowers
docs
e2e
playwright-report
test-results
